== About
I am an undergraduate student in Mathematics and Applied Mathematics at the School of Science and Engineering, The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. 
My interests lie in optimization for machine learning, deep learning, and the mathematical foundations of machine learning.
== Education
- *B.Sc. in Applied Mathematics*, The Chinese University of Hong Kong,
  Shenzhen, Sept. 2025 -- May 2029 (expected).

== Experience
- *Research Assistant*, CUHK-Shenzhen, May 2026 -- July 2026.

== Research Interests
- Optimization for machine learning and deep learning.
- Optimization theory and first-order methods.
- Mathematical foundations of machine learning.

